  "body": "**Description**\r\nWhen 2 servers are federated, all users from the other server do not show up in the search results.\r\n\r\n**Steps To Reproduce**\r\nFederate 2 homeservers with each other and call /_matrix/client/r0/user_directory/search or search from your client.\r\n\r\nOnly some of the results from the federated homeserver show up in the list. List of results may increase overtime.\r\n\r\n**Version Information**\r\nSynapse 1.32.2\r\nInstallation Method: Debian/Ubuntu Package",
